Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞身跃入这扇门中去获得全新的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我自己与游马构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量变换 泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 泽阿尔武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独角兽斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《九十九游马……》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:01:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哈鲁特 等着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早 我会与那家伙做个了断》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～ 迟到 迟到 迟到。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）等一下 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊！我正赶时间呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你昨天夜里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来的时候浑身是伤吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我不太想这么想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这篇报道里写的海滨地区仓库倒塌和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该不会跟你有什么关系吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能跟我有关系啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说是个挺奇怪的事故。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有者心园还搞了报道管制{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事故原因也不清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟 迟到 迟到！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么事让你这么慌张？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊 你姐姐她……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 皇之键和鲨鱼的灵魂都回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是好事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 顺便 你也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 我也有些动摇了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 他居然连皇之键里面都能进来……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人 快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 总是让人吃惊不断啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么来头？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是快斗啊 真是的浑身是谜的家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 有一点我可以确定。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他能自如地操控 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在至今为止的决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操控 No.卡的决斗者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:03:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都从 No.卡那里受到了某种影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……快斗身上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种痕迹完全看不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他或许正在使用某种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界所没有的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？那到底是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道……但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他所操控的银河眼……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽身上寄宿的光芒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许和我世界的那个很接近……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，那家伙为什么要收集 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers是你的记忆吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能想到的可能就是抹杀我的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抹杀？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，要是我的记忆恢复了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能会有不妙的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之目前能确定的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他行动的理由在于他弟弟哈鲁特这个存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了弟弟把灵魂卖给了恶魔…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张照片就是哈鲁特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！迟到了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那朵云是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟什么哟啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊 可恶～ 迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 都怪游马啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}昨天让人那么担心……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托你的福我才睡过头了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也有责任的好吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊 迟到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 冷静点啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 没事就好 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是那边啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:05:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 你说什么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 什么啊 你们也迟到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太兴奋了怎么也睡不着啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底是因为太累了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 大家 昨天谢啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯、凯特酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}昨天玩得很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）反正我又没去啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事情我都听说了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我们也是慌慌张张的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 我们不是迟到了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话还没说完啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 时间停止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 是快斗干的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 恐怕不是 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）费卡博士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（费卡博士）从星光体世界和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个世界产生了波动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我们的世界重叠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此暂时时间停止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必慌张。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再过几个小时 波动就会穿过我们的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复原状吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 两个世界正在逐渐靠近{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这似乎没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到最终阶段来临剩下的时间不多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之前 要把星光体世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快看 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳有3个……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些太阳中的1个是我世界的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 竟然会发生这种现象。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确定是这里没错吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我追寻了刻在时空中的那些家伙的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙的决斗记忆就是从这里开始的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是星光体的记忆……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 呼唤我 把 No.卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）怎么回事 力量不断涌上来哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 No.17 修正龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来条件就齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看额外卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是 No.卡吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。这是赋予你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顽抗骑士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39！希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是唯一能打倒复仇死龙的王牌…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了…已经，游马输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会那样说，也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己有什么你不是已经放弃了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃了重要的什么你不是已经放弃了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不放弃随时都能燃起来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就让你见识见识！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:11:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击复活之龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…咕呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}头…头快裂开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…有什么人在干涉我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们追溯我们决斗的记忆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）那里就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第三张 No.卡出现的地方…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只怪兽进行超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.34！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:12:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）电算机兽 太字节！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈… 星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 为什么能从我身边离开啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所在世界的太阳曾经出现这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概是某种原因造成的吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈… 所以呢到底有没有人在啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不… 但是至今为止曾有某人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说了等等 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是和德之助决斗过的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 被夺走了 No.我的意识消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把决斗不得不托付给你的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我凭着你留下的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守住宝贝龙 这一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓住了逆转的一手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:13:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 究极C发动乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普被夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝龙 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～ 搞定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是第4张 No.的记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（罗宾）然后 我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级1的特莱恩3只进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.83！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了啊 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:14:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 胜利的豌豆就凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！一飞冲天！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普 攻击银河女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被攻击的怪兽作为替身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来小鸟被绑架的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和猫咪酱也决斗过呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他正看着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 双马尾猫女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把游马迷得神魂颠倒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 对游马他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！宝贝龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝吐息！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.63,0:15:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪 为什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是 和鲨鱼 进行决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 是回收第5张和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第6张 No.卡的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我违背了约定 使用了 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还输给了鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 是为了我自己才再次战斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级5的拳击火焰恐龙和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}波丹熔岩恐龙 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！现身吧，No.61！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火山恐龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级5的怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）现身吧！No.19！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷冻龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是……和快斗决斗过的地方……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……No.猎人快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他向我们展示了压倒性的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们进行了一场等同于败北的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你的灵魂一起就让我来猎取吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了，到此为止……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我们也可并不是那么简单啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从决斗庵的六十郎爷爷那里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}学到了很重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（暗川）我要把你吞掉，小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你的光芒！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连那一丝一毫都不放过！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级５的机甲忍者 土与
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 炎进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！No.１２！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 绯红影！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，和那个叫吉恩的家伙战斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得了新的力量——霍普雷。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吉恩）超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.１６！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}色彩支配者 冲击统治者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吉恩）现身吧，No.１１！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有幻惑之瞳的支配者 大眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我重要的伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿…我也害怕过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是只要不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论是谁都会留有希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我想和你还有你的同伴们一起赢！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…你…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新的胜利方程式此刻，全都齐聚于此！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之力将混沌化为光明的使者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）混沌·超量·变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）现在正是现身之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）希望皇 霍普雷的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）希望皇 霍普雷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）将3个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升霍普雷的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）攻击大眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:20:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 而且 小波咪也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成了我们的新伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是那些家伙的最后的 No.卡记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要毁了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切 都毁灭殆尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇！ 呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇～！ 什么 这是～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经 逃不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的 一飞冲天啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能… 我竟然～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈… 哈… 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个已经没事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么啊乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？游马呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一决胜负就在世界决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求之不得！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可靠的伙伴，真帅啊，我我我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.35,0:24:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的王牌怪兽太帅了！

